      "sourceTextSha256": "31b20b6a9798f201eb7bcec721d6f840e2157afc1f0d44be0a22c9f8e47e68b7",
      "text": "Breakfast, then an early departure from Puno for the Bolivian border. After border formalities, continue to Copacabana.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-qkp8w5l4dosmw9l9yyz",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:b2f9b09694b09c98",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "66090eab14e8ae2ef981103a6cc4bd71d2c092159d6a5cfede628ac7e082cd5e",
      "text": "Take a speedboat across Lake Titicaca to Isla del Sol. Learn about local traditions, witness a symbolic Kallawaya ritual with offerings to Pachamama and have lunch at a restaurant overlooking the lake. Return to the Bolivian shore.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-qkp8w5l4dosmw9l9yyz",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:19816be17db8bcf7",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bb8ba4b32123fad56ba86e6e63c376005a10d1da2415512c284ae54c2c32e8d5",
      "text": "Continue to La Paz, a city in the Andes at around 3,800 m. Check in and spend the night at the 4-star Mitru or a similar hotel. An English-speaking guide for the Lake Titicaca crossing is not listed among the included services. Confirm the guide’s language when booking.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-qkp8w5l4dosmw9l9yyz",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:42670d3b56e49e75",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c51f3f48e4a79fab540aa500495dd58e8c6c5f7dd14b467e0e34cd630b9bc4a8",
      "text": "Boat in shallow water reflecting clouds off Isla del Sol, Bolivia",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-qkp8w5l4dosmw9l9yyz",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
    {
